//REPL terminals
REPL stands for Read Eval Print Loop. It represents a computer environment like windows console.
  1.Read- reads the input, parses it to javascript data-structure and stored it in memory.
  2.Eval- takes and evaluates the data structure.
  3.Print- prints the result.
  4.Loop- Loops the above command until the user presses ctrl-c twice.



